# Graphify exclusions for the Eventiva monorepo.
#
# Git-style syntax. `.gitignore` is already applied automatically and takes
# precedence: a path excluded by `.gitignore` cannot be re-included here.
# Graphify also has built-in skips for `.git`, `node_modules`, `dist`, `build`,
# `target`, virtualenv/cache directories, `.env*`, key and certificate formats,
# and credential stores. The entries below are the Eventiva-specific additions
# and the defence-in-depth restatements that matter for this repository.
#
# See docs/graphify.md for the reasoning and for how to verify exclusions.

# --- Secrets and credentials -------------------------------------------------
# Restated explicitly rather than relying on built-ins alone. If any of these
# ever stop being gitignored, they must still never reach the graph.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.mobileprovision
*.keystore
secrets/
**/secrets/
credentials.json
**/credentials.json

# --- Private and customer data -----------------------------------------------
# The repository holds no customer data today; these keep it that way by
# default if an export, dump or scratch dataset is ever dropped in a clone.
.data/
db/dumps/
**/*.dump
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.csv
**/*.tsv
private/
**/private/

# --- Package managers and vendored dependencies ------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
patches/

# --- Build output and generated code -----------------------------------------
dist/
build/
out-tsc/
web-build/
coverage/
tmp/
.expo/
.next/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.min.js
**/*.map
**/.gen/
**/.terraform/
**/.cdktf.out/

# --- Tool caches --------------------------------------------------------------
.nx/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/
.graphify/
.history/

# --- Editor, CI and agent configuration ---------------------------------------
# Agent rule files are instructions to tooling, not product code. Indexing them
# floods the graph with prose that describes how to work rather than what the
# system does.
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.github/

# --- Binary assets -------------------------------------------------------------
assets/
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.svg
**/*.ico
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2
**/*.ttf
**/*.mp4
**/*.pdf
